<title>PORTUGAL: Inparsa to join EDP in Lisbon's BVL30 stock index.</title>
<headline>Inparsa to join EDP in Lisbon's BVL30 stock index.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wood to tourism group Inparsa will join partially-privatised utility group EDP-Electricidade de Portugal in the BVL30 share index from July 1, the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>The two companies -- EDP's entry had already been announced -- will take the places of ship repairer Lisnave-Estaleiros Navais de Lisboa and drinks group Sumolis.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
